  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.44 - AM031 LINQ terminal enumeration coverage\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM031 multiple-enumeration tracking now covers Contains, ElementAt, and ElementAtOrDefault\n            - Common linear collection instance Contains calls, including List<T>.Contains, are tracked\n            - Regression tests cover Contains plus Sum and Contains plus ElementAt shapes\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (845 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR #119 CI/package smoke checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.43 - AM031 sync-over-async awaiter detection",
